27	1300	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Standard penetration testing is insufficient for AI. Large Language Models (LLMs) are susceptible to unique attacks like prompt injection, where malicious inputs trick the model into bypassing safety filters or leaking training data.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Neozaar’s Adversarial Defense service combines proactive "Red Teaming" (simulated attacks) with runtime "Guardrails" to filter malicious prompts and unsafe outputs in real-time, ensuring your AI agents behave as intended.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Our service covers the full spectrum of offensive testing and defensive implementation for AI systems:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>1. Offensive Testing (Red Teaming)&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Simulated Attacks: Automated and manual AI Red Teaming to identify weaknesses.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Compliance Testing: Comprehensive LLM application testing aligned with the OWASP Top 10 for LLMs.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Robustness Checks: Stress testing the model against adversarial inputs and manipulation attempts.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>2. Runtime Protection &amp; Guardrails&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Input/Output Filtering: Deployment of real-time guardrails to sanitize model inputs and outputs.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Threat Mitigation: Active mitigation of prompt injection attacks and jailbreak attempts.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Anomaly Detection: Detection of hallucinations and toxic or biased model outputs.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>3. Pipeline Security&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>RAG Security: Vulnerability assessment of Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Data Integrity: Analysis of training data for potential poisoning or corruption risks.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"><br></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Neozaar utilizes a "Think Like an Attacker" methodology to secure your AI infrastructure:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 1: Discovery &amp; Analysis: We begin by reviewing system prompts, RAG architecture, and application endpoints to understand the logic and potential attack surface.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 2: Adversarial Attack Simulation: We deploy a library of proprietary adversarial attack patterns, targeting the model to bypass safety filters and extract sensitive data.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 3: Expert Validation: Our human-in-the-loop experts analyze successful breaches to distinguish between model hallucinations and genuine security flaws.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	["Secured AI Logic: AI agents that resist manipulation and adhere to defined behavioral boundaries. ","Data Integrity: Prevention of training data leakage and intellectual property theft. ","Brand Protection: Elimination of toxic or biased outputs that could damage reputation. ","Verified Safety: Confidence that pre-deployment safety validation has been rigorously tested. "]	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Intentional Manipulation: Protection against malicious Prompt Injection attacks.&nbsp;</span></li><li>System Exposure: Preventing accidental disclosure of sensitive system prompts.&nbsp;</li><li>Unsafe Outputs: Mitigating toxic, biased, or harmful model responses.&nbsp;</li><li>IP Theft: Blocking attempts to steal intellectual property via model inversion techniques.&nbsp;</li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"><br></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>			[]	2026-02-24 17:42:01.004	2026-07-24 12:33:39.067
160	1559	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Managed Backup &amp; Recovery service provides ongoing operational management of backup and recovery environments across on-premises, cloud and SaaS workloads.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The service helps organizations ensure backup jobs are monitored, failures are addressed, protection policies remain aligned to business requirements and recovery readiness is maintained over time.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The objective is to reduce the operational burden on internal teams while improving backup reliability, recovery visibility and overall business resilience.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW38341195 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW38341195 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW38341195 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Backup environment onboarding</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW38341195 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW38341195 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Apt