80	1353	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Traditional annual penetration tests often miss vulnerabilities that emerge between audits. Neozaar’s CTEM service provides ongoing visibility into your evolving attack surface by combining automated scanning with expert vulnerability assessment.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>We act as a proactive risk management partner, identifying and categorizing risks by severity and business impact. This ensures your teams focus remediation efforts on the most urgent threats first, shifting your security stance from reactive to predictive.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Our service covers the comprehensive identification and management of vulnerabilities across your digital footprint:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Vulnerability Scanning: Continuous scanning of network, application, and infrastructure layers.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Cloud Review: In-depth review of cloud misconfigurations and access policies.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Risk Classification: Mapping of vulnerabilities to severity levels and business impact.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Remediation Roadmap: Creation of a clear roadmap with tracking for remediation progress.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Human Defense: Employee security awareness training and phishing simulations.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Neozaar utilizes a continuous, closed-loop methodology to manage exposure:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 1: Mapping: We perform External Attack Surface Mapping to identify all internet-facing assets and "shadow IT".&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 2: Simulation: We validate existing controls through Penetration Testing Simulation, mimicking real-world attacker behaviors.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 3: Monitoring: We deploy automated security audits and configuration drift detection to alert on unauthorized changes.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 4: Risk-Based Prioritization: We prioritize patches based on real-world exploitability and specific business risk, not just CVSS scores.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	["Strategic Advantage: Transformation of vulnerability management from a \\"chore\\" into a strategic advantage.","Verified Security: Closed-Loop Remediation ensures that applied patches have actually fixed the issue. ","Business Context: Understanding of exactly which bugs hurt business revenue via Business Context Scoring. ","Visualized Risk: Attack Path Analysis visualizing how small vulnerabilities can lead to critical compromises. ","Financial Benefits: Readiness for M&A due diligence and potential reduction in cyber insurance premiums. "]	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Compliance Gaps: Addressing gaps with regulations like GDPR, HIPAA, and PCI-DSS.&nbsp;</span></li><li>Attack Surface Growth: Managing the unmanaged growth of cloud and SaaS tool attack surfaces.&nbsp;</li><li>Data Exposure: Fixing misconfigurations that lead to accidental data exposure.&nbsp;</li><li>Risk Quantification: Overcoming the inability to quantify cyber risk for executive stakeholders.</li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>			[]	2026-02-26 09:02:05.707	2026-07-24 12:39:10.882
