77	1350	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>If your domain is poorly secured, attackers can send emails appearing to be from your company, damaging your brand and tricking your customers.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Neozaar’s DMARC Governance service moves your organization to a "Reject" policy safely. We analyze your legitimate third-party senders (like Mailchimp or Salesforce), authorize them correctly, and block all unauthorized spoofing attempts. This not only secures your brand but also ensures your legitimate marketing and business emails don't end up in the recipient's junk folder.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Our service covers the full journey from initial audit to strict enforcement:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Audit: comprehensive audit of current SPF and DKIM records.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Deployment: DMARC record deployment, managing the transition from monitoring (p=none) to enforcement (p=reject).&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Alignment: Verification and alignment of third-party senders (Salesforce, HubSpot, etc.).&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Monitoring: Continuous monitoring of spoofing attempts and forensic analysis.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Reporting: Weekly "Threat Intelligence" reports on domain abuse.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Neozaar utilizes a "Safe-Block" methodology to secure your email channels without disrupting business:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 1: Audit Mode: We monitor in "audit mode" first to gain full visibility without blocking any legitimate traffic.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 2: Vendor Alignment: We apply pre-built configurations for 100+ common SaaS senders to authorize legitimate marketing and HR tools.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 3: Safe Enforcement: Once verified, we confidently switch policies to "Reject," stopping attacks while ensuring high open rates for your marketing team.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	["Spoofing Prevention: Hackers are blocked from using your domain name for phishing. ","Improved Deliverability: Increased likelihood that your emails reach the primary inbox rather than spam. ","Brand Visibility: Readiness for BIMI (Brand Indicators for Message Identification) to display your logo in supported clients. ","Full Visibility: Detailed reporting on exactly who is sending mail on behalf of your domain. ","Forensic Insight: Deep analysis of failed authentication attempts to identify specific attack trends. "]	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Brand Impersonation: Protection against "wild" impersonation attacks.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Spam Classification: Preventing legitimate emails from being marked as "Spam" by recipient servers.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Shadow IT: Identification of unauthorized use of corporate domains by internal teams.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Trust Erosion: Restoring partner trust lost due to phishing emails appearing to come from you.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>			[]	2026-02-26 06:34:21.988	2026-07-24 12:40:23.788
