90	1374	<div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><p class="Paragraph SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: auto 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: justify"><span class="TextRun SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">Migrating to the cloud without deeply integrating your existing Microsoft commercial agreements leaves massive financial benefits on the table while exposing your organization to inherited security risks.&nbsp;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">Neozaar’s</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"> </span></span><span class="TextRun SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">Azure Accelerate &amp; Secure Migration Assessment</span><span class="TextRun SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"> provides uncompromised visibility into your On-Premises, Hybrid, or Multi-Cloud environments.</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><p class="Paragraph SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: auto 0px; padding: 0px; text-align: justify"><span class="TextRun SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">By strategically&nbsp;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">leveraging</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW6005222 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">&nbsp;the Azure Accelerate framework, Neozaar consultants analyze your compute performance, security configurations, and enterprise licensing agreements (Microsoft EA, SA). We map these metrics against the Azure ecosystem to uncover massive right-sizing opportunities, formu