76	1349	<p class="MsoNormal"><span>Traditional firewalls that only monitor ports and protocols\nare insufficient against modern application-layer threats. Without constant\nmanagement, firewall rules become bloated, creating security gaps and\nperformance bottlenecks.</span></p><p style="margin: 0px">\n\n</p><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>Neozaar</span></b><span>&nbsp;provides end-to-end management of Sophos and Check\nPoint environments. We handle everything from complex NAT configurations and\nVPN tunnels to advanced features like Deep Packet Inspection (DPI) and\nSandboxing, ensuring your "first line of defense" is always sharp.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p class="MsoNormal"><span>Our service covers comprehensive management, monitoring, and policy optimization:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>•<span>\t</span>Initial Hardening: Initial firewall hardening and baseline configuration to best practices.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>•<span>\t</span>Protection Tuning: Intrusion Prevention System (IPS) tuning and SSL/TLS inspection management.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>•<span>\t</span>Connectivity: Remote Access and Site-to-Site VPN setup and maintenance.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>•<span>\t</span>** Governance:** Change management, logging audits, and regular rule-base audits to remove "shadowed" or obsolete rules.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>•<span>\t</span>Maintenance: Automated firmware updates and patch management.</span></p><ul>\n</ul><ul>\n</ul><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p class="MsoNormal"><span>Neozaar eliminates the "complexity tax" of\nhigh-end firewalls through a specialized methodology:</span></p>\n\n<ol>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><b><span>"Clean-Slate"\n     Optimization:</span></b><span>&nbsp;We utilize a "Clean-Slate" rule optimization\n     methodology to remove bloat and overly permissive rules.</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><b><span>Deep\n     Integration:</span></b><span>&nbsp;We integrate 