99	1393	<p><span style="border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px">The Hybrid Connectivity Deployment program enables organizations to securely connect their on-premises infrastructure with Microsoft Azure, creating a reliable and scalable hybrid cloud environment.</span></p><p><span style="border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px">Delivered as a structured 2-week engagement, NeoZaar designs and implements secure connectivity using Site-to-Site VPN, Point-to-Site VPN, or ExpressRoute-ready architecture.</span></p><p><span style="border: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px">This service allows enterprises to extend their data center into Azure, enabling phased migration, hybrid applications, secure access, and disaster recovery use cases—without disrupting existing operations.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	<ul><li>Hybrid connectivity architecture design</li><li>Site-to-Site VPN implementation</li><li>Point-to-Site VPN configuration (if required)</li><li>Azure VNet integration and routing setup</li><li>Basic network segmentation</li><li>Connectivity validation and performance testing</li><li>Documentation and knowledge transfer</li></ul><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	<ul><li>Discovery of current on-prem network and architecture</li><li>Hybrid connectivity design (VPN / ExpressRoute-ready)</li><li>Azure Virtual Network (VNet) integration</li><li>Secure routing and segmentation setup</li><li>Connectivity deployment and validation</li><li>Performance testing and handover</li></ul><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	["Secure and stable hybrid connectivity","Seamless communication between on-prem and Azure","Reduced migration risk and downtime","Foundation for phased cloud adoption","Readiness for migration, AI, and enterprise workloads"]	<ul><li>Lack of secure connectivity between on-prem and cloud</li><li>High risk of disruption during cloud adoption</li><li>Inability to migrate workloads incrementally</li><li>Network misconfigurations and complexity</li><li>Limited visibility and control across hybrid environments</li></ul><p style=" margin: 0"></p>			[]	2026-04-16 06:22:08.748	2026-08-06 07:37:06.118
