11	1284		<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Design and testing of backup and recovery policies.&nbsp;</span></li><li>Setup of hybrid disaster recovery to public cloud environments.&nbsp;</li><li>Implementation of "Zero Trust" principles for data access.&nbsp;</li><li>Post-incident assessment and recovery guidance.&nbsp;</li><li>Annual Disaster Recovery (DR) drills.</li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>		[]	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Extended downtime following a ransomware attack.&nbsp;</span></li><li>Data loss due to accidental deletion or hardware failure.&nbsp;</li><li>"Silent" backup failures discovered only during a crisis.&nbsp;</li><li>High cost of maintaining a secondary "Hot Site" for DR.&nbsp;</li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Integrated Security: We treat backup as a security layer, not just IT storage.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span>Instant VM Boot: Ability to run servers directly from the backup file in minutes.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span>Forensic Sandbox: Safely test backups for malware before restoring them&nbsp;</span>to production.&nbsp;</li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Neozaar provides the ultimate insurance policy. We ensure that no matter what happens—fire, flood, or hack—your business is back online and generating revenue while your competitors are still figuring out what went wrong.&nbsp;</span></p><div><br></div><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	["ESET","Acronis","AvePoint","Check Point","CrowdStrike Falcon","SonicWall","Varonis","IBM"]	2026-02-23 20:00:28.99	2026-07-24 12:44:41.12
