141	1540	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Migration Planning &amp; Discovery service helps organizations convert cloud migration intent into an executable migration plan.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The engagement creates a detailed view of applications, infrastructure, databases, integrations and dependencies, and uses that information to define migration groups, sequencing, technical requirements, risks and stakeholder responsibilities.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The service is designed for organizations that have decided to migrate but need a structured execution plan before beginning workload movement.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW4490079 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW4490079 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW4490079 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Application and infrastructure discovery</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW4490079 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW4490079 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-fam