109	1405	<p class="MsoNormal"><span>For SaaS marketplace offers, the moment after purchase is critical.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>When a customer clicks “Get It Now” on a marketplace listing:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>•<span>\t</span>They are redirected to your landing page</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>•<span>\t</span>Your system must identify the subscription</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>•<span>\t</span>The SaaS account must be activated</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>If this flow is broken:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>❌ Customers drop off</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>❌ Billing may fail</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>❌ Marketplace validation may be rejected</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>This service ensures a seamless purchase → activation → usage experience.</span></p><div><br></div><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>🔹</span></b><b><span> Landing Page Setup</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Landing\n     page URL configuration</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>User\n     journey design</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Messaging\n     and instructions</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Form\n     and input handling</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><span>\n\n\n\n</span></div>\n\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>🔹</span></b><b><span> Purchase → Activation Flow</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Marketplace\n     redirect handling</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Subscription\n     identification</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Account\n     creation flow</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><span>\n\n\n\n</span></div>\n\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>🔹</span></b><b><span> Token &amp; Authentication Handling</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Secure\n     token validation</span>