127	1521		<p class="MsoNormal"></p><ul><li>Multi-region continuity architecture design</li><li>Infrastructure and application dependency mapping</li><li>Autonomous failover configuration and orchestration</li><li>Regional recovery testing and validation</li><li>Continuity optimization roadmap for critical workloads</li></ul><p></p>\n\n<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center">\n\n\n\n</div><p style=" margin: 0"></p>		[]	<div style="text-align: left"><p class="MsoNormal"></p><ul><li>Regional infrastructure outages impacting availability</li><li>Manual failover processes causing extended downtime</li><li>Single-region dependency for critical applications</li><li>Limited visibility into cross-region recovery readiness</li><li>Complex coordination across distributed environments</li></ul><p></p></div><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	<p class="MsoNormal"></p><ul><li>Autonomous failover architecture for distributed\nenvironments</li><li>Built for hybrid and multi-cloud resilience strategies</li><li>Intelligent workload failover based on health monitoring</li><li>Enables seamless continuity across geographically distributed regions</li><li>Reduces recovery time during large-scale infrastructure disruptions</li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	<p class="MsoNormal">Neozaar enables organizations to move beyond traditional\nsingle-site disaster recovery by implementing autonomous multi-region\ncontinuity architectures. By automating failover and maintaining distributed\nrecovery readiness, the solution ensures critical services remain available\neven during large-scale infrastructure or regional disruptions.</p><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	["AWS","Microsoft","Google","Veeam","Commvault"]	2026-06-09 07:57:21.908	2026-06-29 05:19:59.466
