108	1404	<p class="MsoNormal"><span>To make your product purchasable via cloud marketplaces, it must behave like a native cloud service — with proper subscription, billing, and lifecycle handling.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"></p><ul><li><span>This requires integration with:</span></li><li><span>SaaS Fulfillment APIs (Azure)</span></li><li><span>Metering &amp; Entitlement APIs (AWS)</span></li></ul><p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span>This service enables your product to:</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"></p><ul><li><span>Activate subscriptions after purchase</span></li><li><span>Sync plan and seat updates</span></li><li><span>Handle suspension, reinstatement, and cancellation</span></li><li><span>Align billing with AWS and Azure</span></li></ul><p></p><ul>\n</ul><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>🔹</span></b><b><span> Azure SaaS Fulfillment Integration</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Landing\n     page flow (purchase → redirect)</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Activation\n     flow</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Plan\n     and seat update handling</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Suspend\n     / reinstate logic</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Webhook\n     handling</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><span>\n\n\n\n</span></div>\n\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>🔹</span></b><b><span> AWS Metering &amp; Entitlement Integration</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Metering\n     API integration</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Usage-based\n     billing alignment</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Entitlement\n     validation</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Subscription\n     lifecycle handling</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><span>\n\n\n\n</span></div>\n\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>🔹</span></b><b><span> Subscription Lifecycle Management</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Activation</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Updates</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Suspension</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Reinstatement</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Cancellation\n     handling</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><span>\n\n\n\n</span></div>\n\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>🔹</span></b><b><span> Authentication &amp; Security</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Secure\n     API authentication</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Token\n     handling</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Access\n     validation</span></li>\n</ul><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>1.\nIntegration Discovery</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Understand\n     product architecture</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Identify\n     integration points</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Define\n     API readiness</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><span>\n\n\n\n</span></div>\n\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>2.\nAPI Flow Mapping</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Map\n     subscription lifecycle</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Define\n     required API flows</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Align\n     backend logic</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><span>\n\n\n\n</span></div>\n\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>3.\nIntegration Design</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Authentication\n     setup</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>API\n     endpoint structure</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Subscription\n     handling logic</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><span>\n\n\n\n</span></div>\n\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>4.\nImplementation Guidance</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Work\n     with engineering teams</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Validate\n     API flows</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Ensure\n     compliance with marketplace requirements</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class="MsoNormal" align="center" style="text-align:center"><span>\n\n\n\n</span></div>\n\n<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>5.\nTesting &amp; Validation</span></b></p>\n\n<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Simulate\n     purchase scenarios</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Validate\n     subscription lifecycle</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Confirm\n     billing alignment</span></li>\n</ul><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	["Fully integrated SaaS backend for marketplace","Subscription lifecycle synchronized with cloud","Billing alignment with AWS / Azure","Product ready for transactable listing"]	<ul>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Complexity\n     of SaaS API integration</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Billing\n     mismatches</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Subscription\n     lifecycle errors</span></li>\n <li class="MsoNormal"><span>Marketplace\n     rejection due to incomplete integration</span></li>\n</ul><p style=" margin: 0"></p>			[]	2026-04-23 09:46:17.536	2026-08-07 11:30:24.165
144	1543	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Database Migration service helps organizations move databases from on-premises, hosted, legacy or existing cloud environments to modern cloud-based database platforms.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The service covers database assessment, compatibility review, migration planning, schema and data migration, replication, testing, cutover and post-migration validation.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The objective is to reduce migration risk while maintaining data integrity, application compatibility, availability and performance throughout the transition.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW161727617 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW161727617 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW161727617 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Database inventory and discovery</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW161727617 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW161727617 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_