178	1578	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s PCI DSS Readiness &amp; Gap Assessment helps organizations evaluate their preparedness for PCI DSS compliance across environments that store, process or transmit payment card data.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The engagement reviews the cardholder data environment, security controls, access management, vulnerability management, logging, testing practices and compliance evidence to identify control gaps and areas requiring remediation.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The outcome is a structured PCI DSS readiness view with prioritized findings and a practical roadmap for improving compliance and security posture.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW174474655 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW174474655 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW174474655 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Cardholder data environment scoping</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW174474655 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW174474655 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0p