84	1357	<div style="text-align: justify"><span>This engagement provides a clear, high-level snapshot of your current cloud security posture. It is designed to help stakeholders quickly understand risk exposure, identify critical visibility gaps, and determine the necessary next steps without a heavy operational lift.</span></div><div><br></div>	<p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px"><span>Identity Exposure: Identification of high-risk identity and access exposure indicators.</span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px"><span>Network Risk: Analysis of network and workload risk signals (e.g., open ports, public exposure).</span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px"><span>Data Visibility: Assessment of data protection gaps and visibility blind spots.</span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px"><span>Compliance Alignment: High-level review of alignment with standard compliance frameworks.</span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px"><span>Maturity Benchmarking: Evaluation of current security maturity indicators.</span></p><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 0px"><span>Tool Enablement &amp; Recommendations: High-level identification of capability gaps where native cloud tools are insufficient and recommendation of CSPM/SIEM solutions.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<div style="text-align: justify"><span>Non-Intrusive Discovery: Utilizes read-only access and structured inputs to gather data.</span></div><div style="text-align: justify"><span>Architecture Review: High-level review of cloud architecture and key configurations.</span></div><div style="text-align: justify"><span>Zero Disruption: Designed to be a passive assessment with no production changes or impact.</span></div>	["Security Snapshot: A clear, executive-level view of the current security posture.","Risk Prioritization: A prioritized view of risks to focus immediate attention.","Focus Areas: Identification of key technical areas requiring improvement.","Strategic Guidance: Recommendations on whether a deeper, detailed assessment is required."]	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Limited Visibility: Lack of clarity on "what is running where" and its security state.</span></li><li><span>Unknown Risk Exposure: Uncertainty regarding open vulnerabilities or misconfigurations.</span></li><li><span>Shadow IT: Unmanaged assets or identities creating silent risks.</span></li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>			[]	2026-02-26 09:27:07.409	2026-08-06 12:24:39.438
29	1302	<span>As cloud environments grow, inefficiencies often arise due to limited visibility and opaque billing data. Neozaar helps organizations establish immediate clarity on their cloud spend. This entry-level engagement provides a high-level "Readiness Summary," offering a clear snapshot of cost efficiency and identifying immediate areas of concern without requiring deep integration.&nbsp;</span><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<span>O</span><span>ur analysis service focuses on high-level data gathering and visibility:&nbsp;</span><div><span><br></span></div><div><span>Spend Review: Review of cloud spend distribution and cost concentration across accounts/subscriptions.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span>Waste Identification: Identification of idle and underutilized resource indicators.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span>Efficiency Signals: High-level analysis of architecture efficiency signals.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span>Trade-off Analysis: Analysis of performance and availability cost trade-offs (e.g., spot vs. on-demand usage).&nbsp;</span></div><div><br></div>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Neozaar utilizes a non-intrusive methodology to gather data:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Discovery (Read-Only): We begin with a review of billing and usage data (CUR/Cost Management) to establish a baseline.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Architecture Alignment: We review high-level architecture diagrams to map spend to actual workloads.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Snapshot Generation: We synthesize findings into a "Cost Efficiency Snapshot."&nbsp;</span></p><div><br></div><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	["Cost Clarity: Improved visibility into \\"who is spending what\\" across the organization. ","Waste Detection: Immediate iden