28	1301	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Meeting regulatory requirements in the cloud is a moving target. This service focuses specifically on the "Compliance" aspect of CSPM, turning manual audit preparation into a continuous, automated process.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Neozaar maps your cloud configurations to specific regulatory controls (like PCI-DSS for retail or FedRAMP for government). Our solution generates "audit-ready" reports at any time, proving to stakeholders that your cloud environment has maintained its required security posture every minute of every day, not just during the audit window.&nbsp;</span></p><div><br></div><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Our service covers the full lifecycle of regulatory alignment and evidence generation:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Asset Mapping: Mapping cloud assets directly to regulatory controls (PCI, HIPAA, NIST, etc.).&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Dashboarding: Configuration of automated compliance dashboards for real-time visibility.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Policy Enforcement: Implementation of "Policy-as-Code" to actively prevent non-compliant deployments.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Review Cycles: Quarterly compliance reviews and tuning to adapt to changing regulations.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Audit Prep: Conduct mock audit sessions to prepare internal teams for the real thing.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Neozaar utilizes a structured, expert-led methodology to bridge the gap between technical settings and legal requirements:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 1: Automated Mapping: We translate obscure legal requirements into concrete technical rules, mapping single controls (e.g., encryption) to multiple regulations at once.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 2: Continuous Monitoring: We implement 24/7 tracking against 50+ global frameworks to detect drift immediately.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 3: Expert Support: Unlike standard tools, Neozaar experts sit with you during actual audits to explain reports and evidence to auditors.&nbsp;</span></p><div><br></div><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	["Audit Readiness: Instant generation of audit-ready documentation and evidence for internal/external auditors. ","Reduced Risk: Immediate notification (Drift Alerting) when changes push resources out of compliance. ","Clear Roadmap: A regulatory gap analysis providing a clear path to reaching a certified state. ","Operational Confidence: Transformation from \\"once-a-year panic\\" to \\"day-to-day confidence,\\" allowing faster entry into regulated markets. ","Remediation Guidance: Step-by-step playbooks to fix specific compliance failures. "]	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Manual Effort: Eliminating time-consuming and expensive manual audit preparations.&nbsp;</span></li><li>Financial Risk: Reducing the risk of heavy fines for non-compliance.&nbsp;</li><li>Translation Gaps: Overcoming the difficulty of translating technical cloud settings into "Legal/Compliance" language.&nbsp;</li><li>False Security: Avoiding "Check-box" compliance that doesn't actually improve real-world security.&nbsp;</li></ul><p></p><div><br></div><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>			[]	2026-02-24 17:54:49.097	2026-08-07 07:38:06.769
