176	1576	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s DPDPA Readiness &amp; Gap Assessment helps organizations understand their preparedness for India’s Digital Personal Data Protection framework.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The engagement reviews how digital personal data is collected, processed, stored, shared, retained and protected across the organization. It evaluates policies, operational processes, technology controls, third-party relationships and available evidence to identify compliance gaps and implementation priorities.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The outcome is a structured DPDPA readiness view with identified gaps, risk priorities and a practical remediation roadmap.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW21699057 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW21699057 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW21699057 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Personal data processing landscape review</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW21699057 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW21699057 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font