140	1539	<div><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Cloud Migration Assessment helps organizations determine how existing workloads, applications and infrastructure should move to the cloud.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 14px">The engagement evaluates workload suitability, dependencies, technical complexity, business criticality, security requirements and migration risks to identify the most appropriate migration path for each workload.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 14px">The assessment helps organizations reduce migration uncertainty, prioritize workloads and build a structured roadmap covering migration sequencing, target architecture considerations and modernization opportunities.</span></div><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW142329476 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW142329476 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW142329476 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Infrastructure and application discovery</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW142329476 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW142329476 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_Embedd