149	1548	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Cloud Hardening service helps organizations improve the security of existing cloud environments by applying stronger configurations, access controls and security baselines.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The engagement focuses on reducing avoidable cloud risk across compute, storage, networking, identity, logging and workload configurations. It is particularly useful after a cloud security assessment, migration or rapid cloud expansion where security standards may not have been consistently applied.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The objective is to establish a stronger and more consistent security baseline across the cloud environment without unnecessarily disrupting business workloads.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW202990792 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW202990792 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW202990792 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Cloud configuration hardening</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW202990792 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW