135	1534	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Landing Zone Implementation service establishes the foundational cloud environment required for secure and scalable cloud adoption.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The service creates a standardized cloud foundation covering account or subscription structure, identity, networking, security controls, governance policies, logging, monitoring and operational guardrails.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">A well-designed landing zone helps organizations accelerate migration and application deployment while maintaining consistency, security and governance across cloud environments.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW132826850 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW132826850 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW132826850 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Cloud account or subscription structure</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW132826850 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW132826850 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px;