153	1552	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Business Continuity Assessment helps organizations understand their ability to maintain or restore critical business services following infrastructure failures, cyber incidents, application outages or other disruptions.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The engagement reviews critical workloads, dependencies, backup and recovery capabilities, disaster recovery arrangements, recovery objectives and operational processes to identify continuity gaps and areas of elevated business risk.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The assessment provides a prioritized roadmap to improve organizational resilience and ensure critical systems and data can be recovered within acceptable business timelines.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW203033260 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW203033260 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW203033260 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Business-critical application identification</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW203033260 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="Tex