180	1580	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Managed ISO 27001 Compliance service helps organizations maintain their Information Security Management System after readiness assessment, implementation or certification.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The service provides ongoing support across control monitoring, policy maintenance, risk tracking, evidence management, corrective actions and audit preparation.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The objective is to prevent the ISMS from becoming a point-in-time certification exercise and instead maintain a continuously operating security governance framework.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW45269183 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW45269183 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW45269183 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">ISMS baseline onboarding</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW45269183 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW45269183 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_Embedd