158	1557	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Recovery Testing &amp; Validation service helps organizations verify that backup and disaster recovery arrangements work as intended before a real disruption occurs.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The engagement tests agreed recovery scenarios, validates application and infrastructure recovery, measures actual recovery performance and identifies gaps in procedures, dependencies and operational readiness.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The objective is to provide evidence that critical workloads can be recovered reliably and to identify improvements required to strengthen overall resilience.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW226902030 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW226902030 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW226902030 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Recovery test planning</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW226902030 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW226902030 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925p