156	1555	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Disaster Recovery Assessment helps organizations evaluate whether critical technology services can be restored within acceptable business timelines following a major outage, infrastructure failure, cyber incident or site disruption.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The engagement reviews current disaster recovery architecture, workload priorities, replication, failover capabilities, recovery procedures, dependencies and testing practices.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The assessment identifies gaps between business recovery requirements and current technical capabilities, and provides a prioritized roadmap to strengthen disaster recovery readiness.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW13544516 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW13544516 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW13544516 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Critical application and workload review</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW13544516 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW13544516 BCX0" style="color: windo