157	1556	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Disaster Recovery Implementation service helps organizations establish or strengthen disaster recovery capabilities for business-critical workloads.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The engagement covers recovery architecture, replication, failover, recovery sequencing, runbooks, testing and operational handover. The objective is to ensure critical systems can be restored within agreed recovery time and recovery point requirements.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The service can support on-premises, cloud, hybrid and multi-cloud recovery scenarios, including new DR deployments or modernization of existing recovery environments.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW114794411 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW114794411 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW114794411 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Disaster recovery architecture design</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW114794411 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW114794411 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12p