181	1581	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s ISO 27001 Readiness &amp; Gap Assessment helps organizations evaluate their preparedness for establishing, improving or certifying an Information Security Management System (ISMS).&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The engagement reviews governance, risk management, policies, security controls, roles, evidence and operational practices against ISO 27001 requirements to identify gaps that may affect certification readiness or overall information security maturity.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The outcome is a structured view of current ISMS readiness, prioritized findings and a practical roadmap for remediation and audit preparation.</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW342455 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW342455 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW342455 BCX0" style="background-color: transparent; color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">ISMS scope review</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW342455 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW342455 BCX0" style="background-color: transparent; col