145	1544	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Application Modernization service helps organizations transform legacy or tightly coupled applications into more scalable, resilient and cloud-ready solutions.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The engagement assesses the existing application architecture, technical debt, dependencies and business requirements to identify the right modernization approach. Depending on the application, this may include re-platforming, refactoring, containerization, API enablement, managed database adoption, DevOps automation or cloud-native redesign.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The objective is to improve application performance, scalability, deployment speed and operational efficiency while reducing dependence on aging platforms and infrastructure.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW259151097 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW259151097 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW259151097 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Application architecture assessment</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW259151097 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !importa