133	1532	<p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">NeoZaar’s Cloud Readiness Assessment helps organizations understand how prepared their existing infrastructure, applications and operating model are for cloud adoption.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The assessment reviews the current technology landscape, workload dependencies, architecture, security requirements, operational processes and cloud suitability to identify migration opportunities, risks and gaps.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px"><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span style="font-size: 14px">The outcome is a structured cloud adoption roadmap that helps the organization determine what should migrate, what should modernize, what should remain unchanged and the capabilities required to successfully operate in the cloud.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); margin: 0px"></p>	<div class="SCXW143118304 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW143118304 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW143118304 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Current infrastructure and application discovery</span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW143118304 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !important">&nbsp;</span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW143118304 BCX