1510	399	Time-to-Recover & Time-to-Survive Optimization Suite 	An advanced continuity solution that analyzes and optimizes recovery speed and operational survivability to ensure critical systems restore quickly and sustain operations during prolonged disruptions.	During major outages or cyber incidents, organizations often discover that actual recovery timelines are far longer than expected, threatening business continuity. The Neozaar Time-to-Recover & Time-to-Survive Optimization Suite is a solution designed to analyze recovery workflows, infrastructure dependencies, and backup architectures to reduce restoration time while ensuring systems can operate during extended disruptions. By evaluating failover readiness, data recovery performance, and infrastructure resilience, the solution identifies bottlenecks that delay restoration. It then optimizes recovery processes and protection architectures so organizations can recover faster and sustain operations until full service restoration is achieved. 	["Recovery workflow analysis and optimization","Infrastructure and application dependency mapping","Backup and recovery performance benchmarking","Failover readiness and survivability validation","Continuous monitoring of recovery timelines"]	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Disaster recovery optimization&nbsp;</span></li><li>Cyber incident recovery preparedness&nbsp;</li><li><span>Critical workload recovery acceleration&nbsp;</span></li><li><span>Enterprise resilience strategy improvement&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	{CIO,CTO,CFO,"IT Head"}	{"Operational Resilience",Recovery}	{AWS,Azure,GCP}	{Global}	{"Request for Demo"}	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Access to backup, disaster recovery, and infrastructure management platforms&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Visibility into application dependencies and recovery configurations&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Administrative access to monitoring and reporting tool