1512	399	Ransomware Immunity & Immutable Backup Shield	Cyber resilience solution with immutable storage and advanced security controls to protect backups and enable rapid recovery during ransomware or cyberattacks.	Ransomware attacks increasingly attempt to encrypt or delete backup data to prevent recovery and force organizations to pay ransom. The Neozaar Ransomware Immunity & Immutable Backup Shield is a solution designed to protect backup environments using immutable storage, access controls, and continuous integrity validation. By preventing unauthorized modification or deletion of recovery data, the solution ensures trusted backup copies remain available even during sophisticated cyberattacks. This approach strengthens cyber resilience by enabling organizations to restore systems quickly and safely without relying on compromised backup repositories. 	["Immutable backup protection for critical data","Advanced access controls for backup environments","Continuous backup integrity verification","Protection against ransomware targeting backup systems","Rapid restoration from trusted recovery copies"]	<ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW102505625 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW102505625 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">Ransomware recovery preparedness</span></span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW102505625 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="SCXW102505625 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br class="SCXW102505625 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"></span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW102505625 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW102505625 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">Secure backup infrastructure deployment</span></span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW102505625 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="SCXW102505625 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br class="