1609	127	Zero Trust Exchange	Cloud-native zero trust security platform that securely connects users, devices, applications, workloads, branches, IoT/OT environments and business partners based on identity, context and policy rather than traditional network trust.	Zscaler Zero Trust Exchange is Zscaler’s integrated cloud-native platform for implementing zero trust across the enterprise. Instead of extending network access through traditional firewalls and VPNs, it acts as an intelligent policy enforcement layer that connects authorized users, devices and workloads directly to the applications and resources they need. This helps organizations reduce attack surface, prevent lateral movement, protect data and simplify security across cloud, SaaS, data centre and distributed environments.	["Zero Trust access architecture ","Identity- and context-based policy enforcement ","Secure user-to-application connectivity ","Secure workload-to-workload connectivity ","Secure internet and SaaS access ","Private application access ","Branch and campus security ","IoT / OT security ","Third-party and partner access ","Application segmentation ","Attack-surface reduction ","Prevention of lateral threat movement ","Data protection ","Cloud-native security enforcement ","Centralized policy management ","Integration across Zscaler security services "]	<div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW226151235 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><ul><li><span><span class="TextRun SCXW226151235 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20.925px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Implement enterprise Zero Trust architecture</span></span><span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW226151235 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 20