1517	401	Just-in-Case Data Resilience Framework	A data resilience framework designed to ensure critical enterprise data remains continuously protected, rapidly recoverable, and resilient against outages, cyberattacks, and unexpected disruptions.	Organizations often focus on disaster recovery only after an incident occurs, leaving systems vulnerable to outages, cyberattacks, or operational failures. The Neozaar Just-in-Case Data Resilience Framework solution establishes a proactive resilience strategy that ensures critical data and workloads remain protected and recoverable at all times. It combines structured backup policies, redundancy planning, and recovery readiness validation to build a resilient data protection architecture. By aligning recovery priorities with business impact, organizations can maintain operational continuity and rapidly restore services when disruptions occur	["Structured resilience planning for critical workloads","Multi-layer backup and redundancy architecture","Recovery readiness validation and testing","Business impact–aligned data protection policies","Continuous monitoring of data protection posture"]	<p class="MsoNormal"></p><ul><li>Enterprise data resilience strategy development</li><li>Business continuity and disaster recovery planning</li><li>Protection of mission-critical workloads</li><li>Improving recovery readiness for cyber incidents</li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	{CISO,CIO,"Compliance Officers","IT Head"}	{"Disaster Recovery"}	{AWS,Azure,GCP}	{Global}	{"Request for Demo"}	<p class="MsoNormal">Access to existing backup and infrastructure architecture\r\ndocumentation<br>\r\nAdministrative visibility into cloud and on-premise workloads<br>\r\nDefined business criticality classification for applications</p><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	One Time	\N	\N	\N	NEO-2026-1217		https://neozaarassets.blob.core.windows.net/assets/assets/1781766730354_6266_Neozaar_Just-in-Case_Data_Resilience_Framework.jpg	{https://neozaarassets.blob