1518	401	Hyperautomated Disaster Recovery Orchestration Platform	An intelligent DR orchestration platform that automates failover, restoration workflows, and dependency coordination across hybrid environments to accelerate recovery & minimize operational disruption	Modern enterprises operate across complex hybrid infrastructures where disaster recovery often depends on manual coordination between teams and systems. These processes can slow down restoration during outages or cyber incidents. The Neozaar Hyperautomated Disaster Recovery Orchestration Platform automates recovery workflows across infrastructure, applications, and cloud environments. By mapping dependencies and executing automated recovery runbooks, it orchestrates failover, restoration, and validation processes in the correct sequence. This ensures faster, consistent recovery while reducing operational risk and downtime during major disruptions.	["Hyperautomated disaster recovery workflows","Intelligent failover orchestration across hybrid environments","Automated recovery runbook creation and execution","Application and infrastructure dependency orchestration","Continuous recovery readiness monitoring and validation"]	<ul><li><span>Enterprise disaster recovery orchestration</span></li><li><span>Automated multi-cloud failover management</span></li><li><span>Cyberattack and ransomware recovery automation</span></li><li><span>Business continuity process automation</span></li></ul><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	{CISO,CIO,"IT Head","SOC Lead"}	{"Disaster Recovery"}	{AWS,GCP,Azure}	{Global}	{"Request for Demo"}	<p class="MsoNormal">Access to backup, recovery, and infrastructure management\r\nplatforms<br>\r\nVisibility into application dependencies and system configurations<br>\r\nAdministrative access to automation, monitoring, and orchestration tools</p><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	One Time	\N	\N	\N	NEO-2026-1218		https://neozaarassets.blob.core.windows.net/assets/assets/1781766650236_2031_Neozaar_Hyperautomated