1520	401	Runbook-as-Code Recovery Automation Engine	Disaster recovery automation solution that converts recovery procedures into executable runbooks for automated failover, restoration, and consistent recovery across hybrid and cloud environments.	Disaster recovery procedures are often documented in static runbooks that require manual execution during outages or cyber incidents, increasing the risk of delays and operational errors. The Neozaar Runbook-as-Code Recovery Automation Engine is a solution designed to convert traditional recovery documentation into automated, executable workflows. By codifying recovery steps and infrastructure dependencies, the platform orchestrates restoration processes in the correct sequence across hybrid environments. This approach enables consistent recovery execution, reduces human error, and ensures faster restoration of critical services during operational disruptions.	["Automated runbook creation and execution","Infrastructure and application dependency mapping","Policy-driven recovery orchestration","Consistent recovery workflow automation","Continuous validation of recovery procedures"]	<ul><li><span>Disaster\r\nrecovery automation</span></li><li><span>Automated infrastructure restoration</span></li><li><span>Cyber incident recovery orchestration</span></li><li><span>Enterprise recovery workflow standardization</span></li></ul><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	{CTO,"DevSecOps Lead","IT Head","SOC Lead"}	{"Disaster Recovery",Recovery}	{AWS,Azure,GCP}	{Global}	{"Request for Demo"}	<p class="MsoNormal">Access to backup, recovery, and infrastructure orchestration\r\nplatforms<br>\r\nVisibility into infrastructure dependencies and recovery workflows<br>\r\nAdministrative access to automation and monitoring tools</p><p style=" margin: 0"></p>	One Time	\N	\N	\N	NEO-2026-1219		https://neozaarassets.blob.core.windows.net/assets/assets/1781766603499_3126_Neozaar_Runbook-as-Code_Recovery_Automation_Engine.jpg	{https://neozaarassets.blob.core.wind