1363	393	Ultimatix HRMS Solution	Ultimatix is a tool to streamline HR Processes from recruitment to exit and rehire\r\n	Ultimatix assist the HR Community by providing them with a Payroll & HRMS solution to streamline HR Processes from recruitment to exit and till re-hiring.\r\n \r\nThe best part of our solution is that it is a Single Platform Solution and saves 55% of the time involved in HR activities. With this solution, over 6,20,000 payslips are generated every month. \r\n	["Loan/Advance Module, Assets Module, Claim, Travel & Reimbursement Module","Employee Transfer, Promotions, Increments & Arrears Module, IT Declaration","HRD Procedures & all types of letter, F&F along with Exit interview","Transfer between 2 companies with all details","Payroll Management, Compliances & Return filings","HRD Procedures & all types of letter, F&F along with Exit interview","Statutory reports, MIS Reports, a Total of 250+ reports","HRMS - Recruitment, Training & PMS Modules  Mobile App – Responsive & Native App for Android & iOS  Time Sheet, Canteen Management  Integration with Attendance Machine & SAP/Oracle /Navision/Other ERP"]	<p class="MsoNormal">Here are some use cases of Ultimatix HRMS based on real\r\ncustomer experiences and product features:</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">1. Employee Lifecycle Management</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">Ultimatix HRMS manages the entire employee lifecycle from\r\nhiring, onboarding, attendance tracking, leave management, to retirement and\r\nrehiring. This unified platform automates HR processes to improve efficiency\r\nand reduce manual errors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">2. Payroll and Statutory Compliance</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">The system simplifies payroll processing including core\r\npayroll calculations, statutory compliance like PF (Provident Fund), ESIC\r\n(Employee State Insurance Corporation), gratuity, and statutory reports. It\r\nensures timely and accurate salary disbursement and compliance with government\r\nregulations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">3. Attendance and Leave Management</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">Ultimatix HRMS tracks employee attendance and manages leave\r\nrequests seamlessly. It integrates attendance data with payroll to ensure\r\naccurate salary calculations based on actual working days.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">4. Expense and Travel Management</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">Employees can submit expense claims and travel requests\r\nthrough the platform, which streamlines approval workflows and expense\r\nreimbursements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">5. Help Desk and Employee Self-Service (ESS)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">The platform includes a help desk module for HR queries and\r\nissues, along with an employee self-service portal where employees can access\r\npayslips, apply for leaves, update personal information, and track their\r\nattendance and benefits.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">6. Exit and Separation Management</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">Ultimatix HRMS handles employee exit formalities, including\r\nclearance processes, final settlements, and documentation, ensuring smooth\r\noffboarding.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">7. Event and Performance Management</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">The system supports event management for HR activities and\r\nperformance appraisal processes, helping HR teams manage employee engagement\r\nand development initiatives effectively.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><br>	{Retail,Healthcare,Government,BFSI,Logistics}	{HRMS}	{AWS,Azure}	{Asia,MENA,APAC}	{"Free Trial"}	<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span>Hardware Requirements:</span></b><span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class="MsoNormal"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class="Ms