1291	401	Unified Endpoint and Backup Protection 	Integrated endpoint security and automated data backup delivering ransomware protection, rapid recovery, and business continuity across all user devices and systems.	Security and Backup are often managed in silos, leading to gaps during a disaster. If an endpoint is hit by ransomware, the primary goal is not just to stop the attack, but to restore the user's data instantly. This solution integrates endpoint protection with automated, immutable cloud backups. Neozaar manages a "double-shield" approach: the security layer prevents the attack, while the integrated backup layer ensures that if a file is modified or deleted, a clean version can be restored with a single click.	["Integrated malware protection and cloud backup ","Ransomware-aware recovery (prevents restoring \\"infected\\" files) ","\\"Instant Restore\\" for critical executive laptops ","Centralized dashboard for security and data health ","Disaster recovery orchestration "]	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Protecting mobile executives and "VIP" users&nbsp;</span></li><li><span>Small to Medium Enterprise total data protection&nbsp;</span></li><li><span>Replacing legacy, non-cloud backup solutions&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p></p><div><br></div><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	{"IT Head","EndPoint Admin",CISO,"Remote Workforce Leaders"}	{"Endpoint Security"}	{AWS,Azure,GCP,"Cloud Agnostic"}	{Global}	{"Request a Demo"}	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Sufficient upload bandwidth for initial backup seeds&nbsp;</span></li><li><span>Identification of critical data folders for protection&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	One Time	\N	\N	\N	NEO-2026-1065		https://neoblob.blob.core.windows.net/neoblobcontainer/1784897324271_5911_Neozaar_Unified_Endpoint_Backup_Protection.jpg	{https://neoblob.blob.core.windows.net/neoblobcontainer/1786007317928_9912_Unified_Endpoint_&_Backup_Protection_Integrated_security_and_automated_cloud_backups_for