1294	401	Identity and Access Management IAM Governance 	A centralized governance framework to manage user identities, automate provisioning and deprovisioning, and enforce policy-driven access controls across all enterprise systems and resources.  \r\n	In modern, hyperconnected workforces, managing "who has access to what" is a significant security and operational burden. Inconsistent access rights and "privilege creep" often lead to unauthorized data exposure and compliance failures. Neozaar’s IAM Governance solution acts as a digital gatekeeper. We centralize identity management into a single source of truth, allowing you to automate the entire identity lifecycle—from Day 1 onboarding to secure, instant offboarding. By moving away from static models to adaptive, identity-centric security, we ensure that access remains secure even as your organization scales. \r\n	["Centralized Identity Life-cycle","Single Sign-On (SSO)","Phishing-Resistant MFA","Self-Service Portals","Compliance Reporting"]	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Employee Onboarding/Offboarding automation.&nbsp;</span></li><li>Secure remote access for third-party contractors.&nbsp;</li><li>Regulatory compliance auditing (SOX, GDPR).&nbsp;</li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	{"IAM Lead",CISO,CIO,"Compliance Officers",DPO}	{"Identity & Access Security"}	{AWS,Azure,GCP,IBM}	{Global}	{"Request a Demo"}	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>HRIS source of truth (e.g., Workday, BambooHR).&nbsp;</span></li><li>Existing Active Directory or LDAP structure.&nbsp;</li><li>List of applications for SSO integration.&nbsp;</li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"><br></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	One Time	\N	\N	\N	NEO-2026-1068		https://neoblob.blob.core.windows.net/neoblobcontainer/1784896557755_6361_Neozaar_Identity_Access_Management_(IAM)_Governance.jpg	{https://neoblob.blob.core.windows.net/neoblobcontainer/1786007968169_1040_Identity_&_Access_Management_(IAM)_Governance_(1)_(1).png}	{"https:/