1622	399	Cloud  	Cloud infrastructure platform that helps organizations migrate data centers, virtual machines, applications and databases to Google Cloud, then modernize them using managed, cloud-native services for greater scalability, resilience, security and operational efficiency.	Google Cloud provides infrastructure, migration tooling and modernization services to help enterprises move workloads from on-premises environments or other clouds to Google Cloud. Its migration approach spans assessment, planning, execution and optimization, with services such as Migration Center helping organizations discover assets, estimate cloud costs, build business cases and evaluate modernization options. After migration, workloads can be modernized using managed compute, container, database, application and data services. 	["Enterprise cloud infrastructure ","Data center migration ","Virtual machine migration ","Application migration ","Database migration ","Migration assessment and discovery ","Migration Center ","Cloud cost estimation and business-case development ","Modernization recommendations ","Managed compute services ","Cloud-native application modernization ","Containers and Kubernetes ","Managed database services ","Hybrid and multi-cloud support ","Backup and disaster recovery options ","Infrastructure automation ","Security and identity controls ","Cloud monitoring and operations ","Application scalability and resilience ","Migration and modernization funding programs "]	<div class="SCXW249763566 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW249763566 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW249763566 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService