1615	399	Workforce Identity 	Identity and access management platform that helps organizations securely manage employee, contractor and partner access to applications and resources across cloud and hybrid environments. 	Okta Workforce Identity is designed to secure and simplify workforce access across applications, devices and environments. It helps organizations centralize authentication, access control and identity lifecycle management while supporting Zero Trust security. The platform can be used for employees, contractors and business partners, and integrates with a broad ecosystem of enterprise applications through the Okta Integration Network.  	["Single Sign-On ","Multi-Factor Authentication ","Passwordless authentication ","Adaptive and risk-based access controls ","Identity lifecycle management ","Automated user provisioning and deprovisioning ","Identity governance capabilities ","Application access management ","Directory integration ","API access management capabilities   ","Zero Trust identity enforcement ","Device-aware access controls ","Zero Trust identity enforcement ","Workforce access policies ","Integration with enterprise SaaS and IT applications ","Centralized identity administration "]	<div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW60705968 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web&quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)"><ul><li><span><span class="TextRun SCXW60705968 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif">Secure employee access to business applications</span></span><span><span class="EOP Selected SCXW60705968 BCX0" style="color: windowtext; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: 22.0875px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(198, 198, 198) !impo