1384	127	AskTheChamp	AskTheChamp turns your documents into an intelligent assistant that answers questions with precise citations.	AskTheChamp is a document intelligence platform that enables organizations to interact with their data using natural language. Users can upload multiple documents—including PDFs, reports, and internal files—and instantly query them to extract accurate, context-aware answers with source citations.\r\n\r\nBuilt on a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) architecture, AskTheChamp ensures responses are grounded in your data, not generic AI outputs. It supports multi-document querying, role-based access control, and scalable deployment for enterprise use cases.\r\n\r\nDesigned for teams working with large volumes of information, AskTheChamp simplifies document search, reduces manual effort, and accelerates decision-making by turning static data into an interactive knowledge system.	["Ask questions across uploaded documents and get precise, source-backed answers.","Query multiple PDFs and files simultaneously with unified context.","Extracts and processes text from scanned documents and images.","Track usage and maintain compliance with recoverable data handling.","Designed for enterprise workloads with large document volumes.","Uses Retrieval-Augmented Generation to ensure responses are grounded in your data."]	<div><span>Internal Knowledge Base:</span></div><div><span>Employees query policies, SOPs, and documentation instantly.</span></div><div><span>HR &amp; Recruitment:</span></div><div><span>Analyze resumes, candidate profiles, and hiring documents.</span></div><div><span>Compliance &amp; Legal Review:</span></div><div><span>Extract clauses, validate documents, and ensure regulatory alignment.</span></div><div><span>Customer Support Enablement:</span></div><div><span>Support teams quickly find answers from manuals and FAQs.</span></div><div><span>Research &amp; Analysis:</span></div><div><span>Summarize and extract insights from reports an