1509	399	RTO/RPO & MTPoD Continuity Optimization Engine 	An intelligent continuity solution that analyzes and optimizes RTO, RPO, and MTPoD objectives to ensure critical business systems meet recovery targets during disruptions or disasters.	Organizations often define recovery objectives such as RTO, RPO, and Maximum Tolerable Period of Disruption (MTPoD), but these targets are rarely validated against real infrastructure capabilities. The Neozaar RTO/RPO & MTPoD Continuity Optimization Engine is a solution designed to assess current recovery configurations, analyze system dependencies, and align recovery capabilities with business continuity goals. By evaluating infrastructure, backup strategies, and application criticality, the solution identifies gaps between expected and achievable recovery outcomes, enabling organizations to optimize resilience strategies and ensure realistic continuity planning.	["Automated analysis of RTO and RPO capabilities ","MTPoD alignment with business critical services ","Infrastructure and application dependency evaluation","Recovery objective optimization recommendations ","Continuous monitoring of recovery readiness"]	<ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW65587762 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW65587762 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">Business continuity planning and validation</span></span></li><li><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW65587762 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="SCXW65587762 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="TextRun SCXW65587762 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW65587762 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">Disaster recovery readiness assessment</span></span></span></span></li><li><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW65587762 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="SCXW65587762 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobOb