1511	399	Zero-Trust Cyber Recovery Vault Architecture	Cyber resilience solution with a zero-trust recovery vault to isolate, protect, and rapidly restore critical data after ransomware attacks, breaches, or data compromise.	Cyberattacks increasingly target backup environments, making traditional recovery systems vulnerable to compromise. The Neozaar Zero-Trust Cyber Recovery Vault Architecture is a solution designed to create a secure, isolated vault environment that protects critical data from unauthorized access and malicious tampering. By implementing strict access controls, logical isolation, and immutable storage protections, the architecture ensures recovery data remains secure even during large-scale cyber incidents. This solution enables organizations to maintain trusted recovery copies and rapidly restore operations following ransomware attacks or data integrity breaches.	["Zero-trust architecture for recovery environments","Secure and isolated cyber recovery vault deployment","Immutable backup protection and data integrity validation","Strict identity-based access controls for recovery systems","Rapid recovery orchestration from protected vault environments"]	<ul><li><span class="TextRun SCXW52516094 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW52516094 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">Ransomware recovery preparedness</span></span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW52516094 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="SCXW52516094 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br class="SCXW52516094 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"></span></li><li><span class="TextRun SCXW52516094 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW52516094 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px">Secure backup isolation and cyber vault deployment</span></span><span class="LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW52516094 BCX0" style=" margin: 0px; padding: 0px"><span class="SCXW52