1591	399	Recover Business Operations After Cyberattack or Disruption 	Restore critical applications, infrastructure and business services after ransomware, cyberattack, system failure or major disruption with tested disaster recovery, cyber recovery and recovery validation capabilities. 	NeoZaar’s Recover Business Operations After Cyberattack or Disruption solution helps organizations restore critical systems and resume business operations after major technology or cyber incidents. \r\n\r\nThe solution combines disaster recovery implementation, recovery testing, ransomware recovery readiness and backup restoration to create a practical and validated recovery capability for business-critical applications and infrastructure. \r\n\r\nNeoZaar can work with existing recovery technologies or recommend suitable global ISV platforms based on workload criticality, recovery objectives, architecture, cyber-risk profile and business continuity requirements. \r\n\r\nThe objective is to reduce downtime, improve recovery confidence and ensure critical services can be restored in a controlled and predictable manner. 	["Recovery of critical applications and infrastructure ","Orchestrated recovery workflows ","Recovery-point validation ","Recovery testing ","Ransomware recovery readiness ","Clean recovery processes where supported ","Recovery sequencing for dependent systems ","Automated or guided failover and restoration ","Recovery runbook development ","Recovery-time and recovery-point alignment ","Backup integration ","Recovery environment validation ","Application dependency consideration ","Recovery monitoring and reporting ","Hybrid and cloud recovery support ","Post-recovery validation "]		{"IT Head",CTO,CISO,CIO,"SOC Lead"}	\N	{AWS,Azure,GCP,"Acronis Cloud",SaaS,On-Premise}	{Global,India,MiddleEast,APAC}	{"Request Assessment"}			\N	\N	\N	NEO-2026-1290		https://neoblob.blob.core.windows.net/neoblobcontainer/1786705971558_972_Recover_Business_Ops.png	{https://neoblob.blob.core