1213	401	Enterprise Application Access EAA	Zero Trust cloud-based solution for secure remote access to internal applications without traditional VPNs.	Akamai Enterprise Application Access (EAA) is a secure remote access solution built on Zero Trust principles to protect internal applications and resources. Unlike traditional VPNs, EAA grants users access only to specific applications and never the full network through the Akamai edge platform. It combines an identity-aware proxy, granular policy controls, multi-factor authentication, and continuous monitoring to reduce risk and prevent lateral movement. EAA supports hybrid environments and enables secure access for employees, partners, contractors, and third parties from anywhere.	["Zero Trust access model for private applications","Identity-aware application proxy","Multi-factor authentication and fine-grained access policies","No inbound firewall openings required","Real-time access monitoring and analytics"]	<ul><li>Secure remote access to on-premises and cloud applications</li><li>Enabling partners and contractors with limited access</li><li>Reducing attack surface compared to VPN-based access</li></ul>	{CISO}	{"Identity & Access Security"}	{Akamai,AWS,Azure,GCP}	{Global}	{"Request for Demo"}	Application connectors deployed in private environments; Identity provider integration; Akamai configuration	Monthly Subscription	\N	\N	\N	NEO-2026-1001		https://neozaarassets.blob.core.windows.net/assets/assets/1772439049375_4106_Akamai_Product_logo_Neozaar.jpg	{https://neozaarassets.blob.core.windows.net/assets/assets/1771929775548_6286_Akamai_Enterprise_Application_Access_(EAA).jpg}	{"https://neoblob.blob.core.windows.net/neoblobcontainer/Akamai Enterprise Application Access (EAA) Neozaar.pdf"}		{"https://neoblob.blob.core.windows.net/neoblobcontainer/Akamai Enterprise Application Access.pdf"}	\N	\N	\N	f	f	2026-02-21 07:01:11.773013	2026-08-17 06:02:48.55	product	t	f	f	397	397	Pending	NA	t	{BFSI,Telecom,SMB}	\N	https://w