1292	401	Virtual Firewall and Micro segmentation for Cloud	Advanced cloud security with virtual firewalls and micro-segmentation to protect East-West traffic and workloads using Sophos and Check Point virtual instances.\r\n	Most cloud breaches happen because of "East-West" movement—threats moving between servers within the same virtual network. Standard cloud security groups often lack the deep inspection needed to stop advanced attacks.\r\n\r\nNeozaar deploys virtual Sophos and Check Point appliances directly into your AWS, Azure, or private cloud environments. This allows us to inspect traffic between virtual machines (Micro-segmentation), providing the same level of granular security in the cloud as you have on-premises.\r\n	["Deep Packet Inspection (DPI) for cloud-to-cloud traffic","Automated scaling of security instances","Unified policy management across On-prem and Cloud","Protection against internal lateral movement","Compliance-ready logging for all internal cloud traffic"]	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Protecting multi-tier web applications in the cloud</span></li><li>Meeting PCI-DSS/HIPAA requirements in AWS or Azure</li><li>Consolidating security management for hybrid-cloud architectures</li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	{"Network Head",CISO,CTO,"DevSecOps Lead"}	{"Network Security"}	{AWS,Azure,GCP,"VMware NSX"}	{Global}	{"Request a Demo"}	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Administrative access to Cloud Tenancy (AWS/Azure/GCP)</span></li><li>Defined application traffic flow requirements</li></ul><p></p><div><br></div><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	One Time	\N	\N	\N	NEO-2026-1066		https://neoblob.blob.core.windows.net/neoblobcontainer/1784897420204_3132_Neozaar_Virtual_Firewall_Micro-segmentation_for_Cloud.jpg	{https://neoblob.blob.core.windows.net/neoblobcontainer/1786008226278_1663_Virtual_Firewall_&_Micro-segmentation_for_Cloud.png}	{"https://neoblob.blob.core.windows.net/neoblobcontainer/NeoZaar Virtual Firewall & Micro-segm